@startuml dp2-strategy
!include _style.puml
title DP#2 Strategy — 환불 정책 알고리즘 교체

interface RefundPolicy <<interface>> {
  +calculateRefund(payment, fareRule): amount
  +isApplicable(): boolean
}
class FullRefundPolicy
class PartialRefundPolicy
class NoRefundPolicy
class RefundHandler <<Context>> {
  +evaluateRefund(pnr, fareClass): RefundRequest
  +previewRefund(pnr, fareClass): amount
  -resolvePolicy(fareRule): RefundPolicy
}
class FareRule {
  -fareClass
  -cancellationPenalty
}

RefundPolicy <|.. FullRefundPolicy
RefundPolicy <|.. PartialRefundPolicy
RefundPolicy <|.. NoRefundPolicy
RefundHandler ..> RefundPolicy : 선택된 정책에 위임
FareRule ..> RefundPolicy : 운임 등급이 정책 결정
note bottom of RefundHandler : 운임 추가 시\nRefundHandler 수정 없이 확장
@enduml
